  "description": "The operation context of OLAX services: who is acting (user, service, on behalf of whom), what caused it, and the W3C trace id that ties one business action together across HTTP calls and integration events. UseOlaxCorrelation() fills it for each HTTP request; Olax.Messaging carries it inside events; Olax.Auditing writes it into every audit entry.",
